d9x|n|One who, or that which, closes; specifically, a boot closer. See under Boot. ; A finisher; that which finishes or terminates. ; The last stone in a horizontal course, if of a less size than the others, or a piece of brick finishing a course.	n:1d2v,46,17;267c,39,8;1w1w,32,3;25l6,0,3~1d2v,46,17;267c,39,8;1w1w,32,3;25l6,0,3	N:pxe,66,8;ex5,47,4;1p8i,40,5;5de,30,3;f6m,23,3~pxe,66,8;1p8i,40,5;ex5,47,4;5de,30,3;f6m,23,3
